    @{Name='aim_fire'; File='../../tools/reference-game/proxy/ai_behaviour_hooks.h'; Old='    if(s) { g.scratch=s->ebp-0x10u;g.call=ai_behaviour_stack_guest_call;g.context=&c; }'; New='    (void)ai_behaviour_stack_guest_call;'; Why='Runs the game calls of aim_fire through the plain host-stack bridge again (the ai_behaviour adapter): torso_aim and the weapon virtuals leave and read their stack residue at another coordinate with other EBX/ESI/EDI/EBP, so preparation 40e788 reads other bytes at fire entry ESP-41h/-61h.'}
